cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this material, please use the following metadata."
title: "PFL — Polish as a foreign language (pre-A1 to B2)"
abstract: >-
  A free, openly-licensed Polish course in English, aligned to the Common
  European Framework of Reference: a pre-A1 orthography and pronunciation
  primer followed by the levels A1, A2, B1 and B2, each with units, a model
  exam, printable materials and native-voice audio.
type: dataset
